# Reference screenshots dropped into the repo for chat context.
# These can contain personal data (IBAN, masked PAN, balances) - never commit.
Screenshot*.png
Screenshot*.jpg
Screenshot*.jpeg

# Personal-finance threat model: never let any of the shared store,
# its journal/wal/shm side-files, or local-only rule overrides land in
# the repo. ~/finances/ lives outside the repo, but a stray symlink or
# accidental copy must not turn into a commit. *.local.* covers both
# counterparty.local.yaml and overrides.local.yaml.
config.toml
data.db
data.db-journal
data.db-wal
data.db-shm
*.local
*.local.*
inbox/
archive/

# Local scratch (snapshots of finances DB, draft design docs)
.backup/
/budget-design.md
